Package: pristar-p15-driver
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cups, cups-filters, python3,
 python3-dbus, python3-gi, python3-pil, bluez, libbluetooth3, libcap2-bin
Recommends: system-config-printer
Description: CUPS driver for the Pristar/Marklife P15 Bluetooth label printer
 The Pristar P15 (a Marklife P15 clone) is a 203 dpi Bluetooth LE label
 printer using the L11 binary protocol.  This package provides:
 .
  * a CUPS filter that converts CUPS raster pages to L11 bitmap commands;
  * a CUPS backend that sends the job over BLE with credit-based flow
    control;
  * a small setcap helper that creates the LE link (BlueZ otherwise picks
    BR/EDR for this printer and GATT never appears);
  * a PPD with the common 22-50 mm label sizes.
 .
 Once installed, the printer appears as a normal CUPS queue and can be used
 from any application's print dialog.
